      "title": "Northern Cyprus ferry disaster: at least seven dead as vessel capsizes – latest updates",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/30/northern-cyprus-ferry-capsizes-latest-news-updates",
      "description": "<p>An estimated 237 people have been rescued but 23 are missing after accident off the coast of northern Cyprus</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/ferry-capsizes-northern-cyprus\">Fatalities after ferry carrying nearly 270 capsizes off northern Cyprus</a></p></li></ul><p>Republican Turkish party MP Sami Ozuslu told the Guardian late on Sunday that the death toll had risen. “Sadly we are now hearing that there are nine or ten dead,” he said.</p><p>The families of passengers were converging on hospitals in Nicosia, Kyrenia and elsewhere, desperate for news of loved ones, he added.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/aug/30/northern-cyprus-ferry-capsizes-latest-news-updates\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-30T15:25:45"
    },
    {
      "title": "At least seven dead and 23 missing after ferry capsizes off northern Cyprus",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/ferry-capsizes-northern-cyprus",
      "description": "<p>Authorities say 237 people rescued and search under way for those who remain unaccounted for</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/ferry-capsizes-northern-cyprus\">Northern Cyprus ferry disaster – latest updates</a></p></li></ul><p>At least seven people have died and 23 people are missing after a ferry carrying nearly 270 passengers and crew capsized off the coast of Turkish-occupied northern Cyprus, local authorities said.</p><p>The territory’s prime minister, Ünal Üstel, told the state-run TRT news channel on Sunday that 237 people had been rescued. A search was under way for those who remained unaccounted for.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/ferry-capsizes-northern-cyprus\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-30T15:12:03"
    },
